**Discussion Points:**

**1. Review of Current Portfolio Companies**  
- **Mark Thompson** presented the performance metrics for our portfolio companies. Notably, **GreenTech Solutions**, which focuses on renewable energy technology, achieved a 25% YoY revenue growth, with projections indicating that it will reach $10 million in EBITDA by Q4 2024.  
- **HealthSmart Technologies**, specializing in telehealth services, has shown slower growth at 10% YoY due to regulatory challenges but has improved its customer acquisition strategy, leading to a 30% increase in user engagement.  
